This extension adds Dark Messiah of Might & Magic modding support to Vortex Mod Manager.

[b]✅ Supported Versions:[/b]
[list]
[*]Steam[/*]
[*]Other versions may need to select the installation location manually.[/*]
[/list]
[b]🛠️ Mod Installation Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]Installs mods with a file or folder named "mm.exe".[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file or folder named "unlimited_edition".[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a "_mods" folder to the game folder itself (no subfolder).[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file or folder named "info.json" to the "_mods" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file or folder named "mm".[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file or folder named one of: "materials", "maps", "bin", "cfg", "media", "resource", "scripts" or "SAVE" to the "mm" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file with the ".vpk" extension to the "vpks" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file or folder named one of: "models", "fx", "sprites", "cloth", "console", "correction", "decals", "detail", "effects", "engine", "envcubemaps", "generic", "hud", "nature", "overlays", "sun", "vgui" or "voice" to the "mm\materials" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file with the ".bsp" extension to the "mm\maps" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a ".sav" file to the "mm\SAVE" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a "config.cfg" file to the "mm\cfg" folder.[/*]
[/list]
[b]📋 Usage Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]You can open several useful files/folders/URLs using the buttons within the folder icon on the Mods toolbar.[/*]
[/list]

